{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_24","type":"agent_message","text":"The fully fused GELU exposed a one-ULP mismatch in ROCm’s Triton `tanh` implementation, and those tiny changes are amplified by the following GEMMs. I’ve isolated it: all surrounding arithmetic can be fused bit-for-bit, while retaining PyTorch’s exact `tanh` kernel between two fused stages."}}
